  "implementation": [
    "Image-root activation and file transfer share one collected bounded worker and original machine/source/domain leases.",
    "No secondary SDK runtime manager or new boot enrollment is created by file access.",
    "Fixed argv, immutable private metadata and original image/mount/overlay lineage are verified before dispatch.",
    "One absolute deadline closes only observation sockets; unknown collection retains admission and leases.",
    "Like HTTP files, a normal activation Exit may be nonzero; activation output is discarded through bounded frames with the SDK 11-MiB ceiling.",
    "Only a correlated file acknowledgement proves transfer success; agent errors, malformed replies, deadlines and overflow prevent file dispatch.",
    "Strict stopped-PID verification, public command/file limits and public protocol/store codecs are unchanged."
  ],
